+# Copyright 2026 FlagOS Contributors
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
+"""Pure Triton + Official FlagTree 0.7.1a2+ (compatible with 0.7.0+) TLE Paged GQA Attention &
+`DG-R2-K8V4` KV Cache Engine for Iluvatar CoreX (`ivcore11`).
+
+Architecture & Physical Layout Overview:
+  1. `DG-R2-K8V4` Three-Plane Physical Page Layout (`6,272 B/page` for `block_size=16, nkv=2, D=128`):
+     - Plane 0 (`K` INT8): `[num_blocks, 16, nkv, D]` (`4,096 B/page`), head-dim contiguous for
+       coalesced `[D, 16]` INT8 `Q @ K^T` SME matrix loads.
+     - Plane 1 (`V` INT4x2 packed in INT8): `[num_blocks, 16, nkv, D // 2]` (`2,048 B/page`) with
+       token-inner stride `(block_stride, 1, 16 * (D // 2), 16)` so all 16 tokens in a page sit
+       contiguously along `n16` for conflict-free `P @ V` loads and 2-shift INT4 nibble unpacking.
+     - Plane 2 (Packed `BF16x2` Scales): 128B-aligned tail (`128 B/page`) packing `(k_scale, v_scale)`
+       into a single `int32` word (`(ks_bf16) | (vs_bf16 << 16)`), halving scale load transactions
+       and expanding KV capacity on BI-V150 to `1,562,416` tokens.
+  2. 1-Warp Pure-TLE Split-KV Decode (`paged_gqa_decode_split_kv_tle_kernel`):
+     Runs at `num_warps=1` (`<= 128 VGPRs`, 2 waves/SIMD across 64 SIMDs), streaming 2 pages
+     (`step_tok = 32`) per iteration with INT8 `Q @ K^T` + BF16 `P @ V_lo` / `P @ V_hi` SME dots
+     and `tle.insert_tile`, paired with `paged_gqa_splitk_merge_quant_tle_kernel` to fuse Split-K
+     LSE reduction directly with `o_proj` input INT8 quantization.
+  3. Two-Stage Dual-SME Prefill / Mixed Attention:
+     - Short-context / `BF16` path (`paged_gqa_stage1_gather_kv_kernel` +
+       `paged_gqa_stage2_colmajor_sme_tle_kernel`, `use_sme=39`): gathers & dequantizes paged
+       `K8V4`/`K8V8` into contiguous BF16 scratch `[slots * NKV, KV_STRIDE, D]`, then runs
+       Col-Major `ChainDot` (`S^T = K @ Q^T`, `O^T = V^T @ P^T`) with Longest-Processing-Time
+       (LPT) reverse causal CTA scheduling and `O(1)` `prefill_seq_idx` (`SEQ_HINT`) lookup.
+     - Long-context (`eff_seq_len >= 2560, m_eff >= 2560`) Hybrid `INT8 K @ Q^T + BF16 V^T @ P^T`
+       `num_stages=2` (`use_sme=7`) pipeline (`paged_gqa_prequant_q_kscale_kernel` +
+       `paged_gqa_stage1_gather_hybrid_kv_kernel` +
+       `paged_gqa_stage2_hybrid_colmajor_sme_kernel`) with LinearLayout `ChainDotKRotate`
+       (`kRotate=1`) register pass-through and lossless Attention Sink (`tokens 0..63`) isolation.
+"""
