+
+    Given an outer raw INT8 allocation of shape `(num_blocks, 3, block_size, nkv, head_dim // 2)`
+    plus a 128-byte aligned scale tail per block, constructs zero-copy `as_strided` views for:
+      - `key_cache`: `int8 [num_blocks, block_size, nkv, head_dim]` (D-contiguous)
+      - `value_cache`: `int8 [num_blocks, block_size, nkv, head_dim // 2]` (token-contiguous, `stride[1]=1`)
