+# Section 3: Analytical BF16 NT Monomorphic Fast Path (`xcore1000` Wave64)
+# Implements 2-CTA/CU co-resident large tiles (`256x160`, composite `256x256 + 256x192`,
+# and single-launch tail-strip `256x192 + 32x64`), 104-CU wave-aligned Split-K, and
