+
+    Covers shapes like `gate_up_proj` (`M=2048, N=12288`: `R0=36` tiles of `256x256` + `R1=16` tiles
+    of `256x192` = `416` CTAs = `4.00` waves) and `o_proj`/`down_proj` (`N=2048`: `12x160 + 1x128` =
+    `104` CTAs = `1.00` wave) in a single kernel launch.
+    """
+    pid = tl.program_id(0)
+    grid_m = tl.cdiv(M, BM)
